      "title": "04 - PASTE REEL RECREATION PROMPT / describe source beats",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.38.1",
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "detailed_description: Recreate the selected source segment with <Subject 2> replacing <Subject 1>. Preserve the source visual style and lighting. [Shot 1] The shot begins from <Picture 1>, the prepared opening composition with the AI persona already in the scene. Preserve her facial structure, eyes, nose, lips, hairline and hair as represented in <Picture 1> and the matching portrait <Picture 2>. Continue through the actions, gestures, head turns, expressions and interactions in <Video 1>, keeping their order and timing. Follow the source clothing, props, environment and camera. Keep the persona recognizable as her expression and viewing angle change. Reproduce any source cuts at the corresponding times. Match the target person's speaking turns in <Audio 1>; when another speaker talks, the persona listens or reacts as in the source.\n\noverall_soundscape: Preserve the original dialogue, distinct voices, pauses, laughter, ambience and sound effects from <Audio 1>.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Preserve any music already present in <Audio 1>; add no new music."
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
