      "title": "V3 / READ BEFORE UPLOADING PICTURE 1",
      "widgets_values": [
        "Picture 1 MUST be a prepared opening frame with your persona already in the source scene, pose and clothing. A standalone selfie/portrait here also guides the opening scene and can replace the intended composition.\n\nPicture 1 feeds BOTH the H3 image reference and MiniMaxH3AddGuide at frame_idx=0. Picture 2 is a matching persona portrait, used only as an identity reference.\n\nStart with a 5-second continuous shot. The default output is 768x1344; prepare Picture 1 at that size, or change node 40 width/height to match its aspect ratio. Dimensions must be multiples of 32. AddGuide center-crops images when the aspect ratio differs.\n\nBase Ref2VA, res_multistep, simple, 20 steps. No Turbo LoRA. Image sizing remains match to bound reference memory. This is not a complete copy of Simply Advanced.\n\nOriginal audio remains connected to H3 and the final MP4. Raw video remains a visual reference, so identity leakage is still possible. A first-frame guide is not an identity guarantee.\n\nStructure checked offline; GPU generation has not been run. Use the updated v3 prompt skill."
